# Generated Drift code is committed on purpose: it keeps `flutter test` and a
# fresh clone working without running build_runner first.
# (No ignore rule for *.g.dart.)

# The local database is a user's own church records — never commit it.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal

